Bind Npc 29070 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 29071 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 797 "[Crack of All Means] We need more antibiotics."
    Journal for karus "You must accept the request of [Order of the Sorcery] Gater."
    Journal for elmorad "You must accept the request of [Order of the Sorcery] Knocker."
    Collect 20 of 370005000
    Collect 100000 coins

Requires (player level >= 56 and player is karus and quest 795 is completed) or (player level >= 56 and player is elmorad and quest 796 is completed)

Rewards
    Give 250000 experience

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Aren't we out of the antibiotics? For now let's go visit gator."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Antibiotics might be out. Let's visit Noker."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "How is your mission going?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "You are out of all the antibiotics? Bring me [100000 Noah] and [Curse Antidote] for me to make more of the antibiotics.\n\nDeliver [100000 Noah] and [Curse Detox] to Gator to help improve antibiotic study following the order of Herga."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "How's your mission going?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "You are out of all the antibiotics? Bring me [100000 Noah] and [Curse Antidote] for me to make more of the antibiotics.\n\nDeliver [100000 Noah] and [Curse Detox] to Gator to help improve antibiotic study following the order of Nez."

On in_progress
    Say "We need [100000 Noah] and [Curse Antidote]. [Curse Antidote] can be found at the merchant."

On claimable
    Show quest "You have it. Let's hurry.\n\nYou'll need to be level 57 for the next mission. Go find Herga.\n\nHere, I'll give you [Timing Flow (Hell Hound)].Vaccinate [Helhound] with this and go back to Herga. Thank you."
